            "I'm allergic to nuts, so I have to be careful about ingredients.",
            "I'm interested in treatments that improve my skin with minimal downtime."
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "judgment": {
      "engagement": "Effective Collaborator",
      "relevance-and-usefulness": "Fully Meets",
      "overall-subtopic-quality": "Exceptional",
      "subtopic-justification": "Comparison of the Mesotherapy and microneedling",
