          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s good to know\u2014downtime is a concern for me. Between CO2 lasers and microneedling, which one is better for someone with visible pores, dark spots, and some sensitivity? I also have a nut allergy, so I\u2019m careful about ingredients in aftercare.",
