          "user_rubrik": "How does CO2 laser treatment work?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "After microneedling, it's best to use a physical (mineral) sunscreen with zinc oxide or titanium dioxide, ensuring it's labeled nut-free and fragrance-free for your allergy and sensitivity. Brands like Vanicream Mineral Sunscreen, Blue Lizard Sensitive Mineral Sunscreen, and Neutrogena Sheer Zinc Dry-Touch are often recommended for sensitive, allergy-prone skin, but always check the ingredient list for potential nut derivatives. For makeup, experts advise waiting at least 24 hours post-microneedling before applying any, as your skin's barrier is temporarily compromised and makeup can increase the risk of irritation or infection [clueweb22-en0033-70-02855][clueweb22-en0030-73-16433][clueweb22-en0030-73-16433:7][clueweb22-en0008-38-11917:9]. If you do wear makeup after this period, use clean brushes and opt for gentle, non-comedogenic products. Always prioritize gentle care and sun protection during the healing phase.",
