          "text": "For optimal microneedling results\u2014especially for dark spots, uneven tone, and visible pores, with minimal downtime and nut allergy safety\u2014follow these post-treatment care essentials:\n\n**1. Immediate Aftercare (First 24\u201348 Hours)**\n- Use only gentle, fragrance-free cleansers and lukewarm water.\n- Apply a pure hyaluronic acid serum or moisturizer to hydrate and soothe (hyaluronic acid is safe, non-comedogenic, and nut-free).\n- Avoid makeup for at least 24 hours to prevent irritation and clogged pores ([clueweb22-en0033-70-02855]).\n\n**2. What to Avoid**\n- No exfoliating acids (AHAs, BHAs, glycolic, lactic, mandelic), retinoids, or vitamin C for 2\u20133 days post-treatment, as these can irritate sensitized skin ([clueweb22-en0033-70-02855], [clueweb22-en0002-45-09794]).\n- Skip fragranced or potentially allergenic products\u2014always check for",
