        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Hi! I\u2019m looking for ways to improve my skin\u2019s appearance besides using serums. Any suggestions?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can I improve my skin's appearance except serums?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Beyond serums, you can enhance your skin's appearance with various products. Consider using retinol or collagen creams to address pores, dark spots, and signs of aging. Incorporate charcoal or witch hazel cleansers for pore refinement. For exfoliation, look into at-home AHA/BHA or glycolic acid peels for uneven tone and dark spots, which offer minimal downtime. Additionally, applying natural zinc oxide sunscreen daily is crucial for preventing new dark spots. Other options include plant-based oils for nourishment and rose water for hydration.",
