          "user_utterance": "Is Mephzotheraphy better than microneedling for pores and dark spots?",
          "user_rubrik": "Is Mephzotheraphy better than micro-needling?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Microneedling is effective for treating visible pores and dark spots, as it helps reduce pore size, addresses hyperpigmentation, and promotes collagen production for overall skin improvement. However, the provided information defines mesotherapy as injecting nutrients under the skin but does not detail its specific effectiveness for pores and dark spots, so a direct comparison cannot be made.",
