          "ptkb_provenance": [
            "1. I'm interested in treatments that improve my skin with minimal downtime.",
            "2. I I am a 40-year-old woman.",
            "3. I've noticed dark spots and uneven tone on my face.",
            "4. I have visible pores on my cheeks and nose.",
            "5. I use vitamin C and Retinol every day in my morning routine.",
            "6. I use AHA BHA serum once a week.",
            "7. - Preferences: User is interested in exploring professional aesthetic treatments like CO2 lasers and microneedling.",
            "8. I usually wear makeup to even out my complexion.",
            "9. I'm allergic to nuts, so I have to be careful about ingredients."
          ]
        }
