      {
        "turn": 3,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s helpful! How exactly does CO2 laser treatment work?",
          "user_rubrik": "How does CO2 laser treatment work?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "CO2 laser treatment works by delivering concentrated beams of light that remove damaged outer skin layers and heat the underlying dermis. This process stimulates your body's natural collagen production, leading to smoother, tighter skin. For your concerns like visible pores, dark spots, and uneven tone, this helps reveal new, healthier skin while improving texture and pigmentation. Newer fractional CO2 lasers, like CoolPeel, create microscopic treatment zones, sparing surrounding tissue. This allows for significant results with minimal downtime, often just a few days of redness and swelling, compared to traditional ablative lasers.",
          "citations": {
