        "turn": 10,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Okay, so there\u2019s no clear comparison for pores. Do people usually combine Mesotherapy and microneedling in a treatment plan?",
          "user_rubrik": "Is Mephzotheraphy better than micro-needling?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "Yes, microneedling techniques are often combined with or used as part of mesotherapy treatments. Devices that combine microneedling with simultaneous infusion of topical skincare ingredients are used to enhance penetration. Microneedling itself is also described as being based on the principles of mesotherapy, especially for applications like hair growth where it can be used with various solutions.",
