      {
        "turn": 3,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "How exactly does CO2 laser treatment work to help with texture and dark spots?",
          "user_rubrik": "How does CO2 laser treatment work?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "CO2 laser treatment works by delivering concentrated light beams that target water in skin cells, vaporizing the outer layer (epidermis). This process removes damaged surface cells, including those with excess melanin responsible for dark spots and hyperpigmentation. Simultaneously, the laser penetrates the deeper dermis, stimulating new collagen production. As the skin heals, new, clearer, and smoother skin emerges, improving overall texture and tone.",
