          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m actually looking to improve my skin\u2019s appearance\u2014aside from serums, what else can I try?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can I improve my skin's appearance except serums?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To improve visible pores, dark spots, and uneven tone beyond serums, consider incorporating face masks. Clay masks can help tighten pores, while brightening or exfoliating masks and scrubs target dullness, dark spots, and uneven texture. Look for specialized creams or moisturizers designed for brightening and pore care. At-home chemical peels, like glycolic acid peels, can also offer significant improvement with minimal downtime. Remember to check all product ingredients carefully for your nut allergy.",
