          "user_rubrik": "Are CO2 lasers and microneedling good for me?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "good questions \u2014 smart to be cautious with pih. practical pre / post microneedling guidance : what to stop before the procedure - retinoids : hold for ~ 3 \u2013 7 days ( longer for stronger / medical retinoids ). - ahas / bhas and vitamin c : stop 48 \u2013 72 hours before. - physical scrubs, peels, benzoyl peroxide and any harsh exfoliant : stop 3 \u2013 7 days. - avoid fragranced, alcohol \u2011 heavy or essential \u2011 oil products right before. gentle things to use pre / post - cleanser : mild, non \u2011 foaming, fragrance \u2011 free. - hydrators : hyaluronic acid, glycerin, ceramides, panthenol, squalane. - soothers : niacinamide, centella / cg, aloe ( if not irritating ). - occlusive at night ( petrolatum or squalane ) to lock moisture while healing. - strict sun avoidance and broad \u2011 spectrum mineral spf 30 + every morning ( reapply ). aftercare tips - keep area clean, avoid makeup 24 \u2013 48 + hours or until provider oks. - avoid heat / sweat",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0002-98-16094:5": -2.6993095874786377,
            "clueweb22-en0044-63-05269:0": -2.962991714477539,
