      {
        "turn": 8,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Perfect summary! Since I prefer minimal downtime, it sounds like microdermabrasion or light microneedling might be safer for me. Is Mephzotheraphy better than micro-needling for pores and pigment?",
